{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49676","headline":"献衷心 · 欧阳炯","name":"献衷心","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见好花颜色，争笑东风。\n双脸上，晚妆同。\n闭小楼深阁，春景重重。\n三五夜，偏有恨，月明中。\n情未已，信曾通，满衣犹自染檀红。\n恨不如双燕，飞舞帘栊。\n春欲暮，残絮尽，柳条空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}